"details":{}},"color":"#aee00b","stack":{"ru":"Мобильная разработка","en":"Mobile development"}},{"project":"piterpy","title":{"ru":"PiterPy","en":"PiterPy"},"url":{"ru":"https://piterpy.com/","en":"https://piterpy.com/en/"},"logo":{"id":"3076056a-6953-48f0-ad10-3b0d7cd31118","title":"piterpy.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/3076056a-6953-48f0-ad10-3b0d7cd31118/piterpy.svg","fileName":"piterpy.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#6638ff","stack":{"ru":"Python","en":"Python"}},{"project":"safecode","title":{"ru":"SafeCode","en":"SafeCode"},"url":{"ru":"https://safecodeconf.ru/","en":"https://safecodeconf.ru/"},"logo":{"id":"d87bdae3-1381-471c-bec8-691bcc7e6abe","title":"safecode.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/d87bdae3-1381-471c-bec8-691bcc7e6abe/safecode.svg","fileName":"safecode.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#fecf16","stack":{"ru":"AppSec","en":"AppSec"}},{"project":"smartdata","title":{"ru":"SmartData","en":"SmartData"},"url":{"ru":"https://smartdataconf.ru/","en":"https://smartdataconf.ru/en/"},"logo":{"id":"e6f0783d-b91c-46c6-be2b-2f113f63c229","title":"smartdata.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/e6f0783d-b91c-46c6-be2b-2f113f63c229/smartdata.svg","fileName":"smartdata.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#44d8b1","stack":{"ru":"Data Engineering","en":"Data Engineering"}},{"project":"tt","title":{"ru":"TechTrain","en":"TechTrain"},"url":{"ru":"https://techtrain.ru/","en":"https://techtrain.ru/"},"logo":{"id":"8349dfdd-d9ed-4be9-9771-007d399c40e9","title":"techtrain.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/8349dfdd-d9ed-4be9-9771-007d399c40e9/techtrain.svg","fileName":"techtrain.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#ff5e29"},{"project":"videotech","title":{"ru":"VideoTech","en":"VideoTech"},"url":{"ru":"https://vtconf.com/","en":"https://vtconf.com/en/"},"logo":{"id":"b28d58c7-2204-4177-b7b9-dd244015638c","title":"videotech.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/b28d58c7-2204-4177-b7b9-dd244015638c/videotech.svg","fileName":"videotech.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#20bdff","stack":{"ru":"Video & Streaming","en":"Video & Streaming"}},{"project":"sysconf","title":{"ru":"sysconf","en":"sysconf"},"url":{"ru":"https://sysconf.pro/","en":"https://sysconf.pro/"},"logo":{"id":"cecf9277-b0dd-4adb-8b66-d748d13ed382","title":"sysconf.svg","url":"/squidex/srm/cecf9277-b0dd-4adb-8b66-d748d13ed382/sysconf.svg","fileName":"sysconf.svg","contentType":"image/svg+xml","details":{}},"color":"#4c5aff","stack":{"ru":"Системное программирование","en":"System programming"}}],"meta":{"title":"Закрытие первого дня конференции | Доклад на SnowOne 2026"},"localeConfig":{"locales":["ru"],"defaultLocale":"ru"},"locale":"ru","conferenceOptions":{"presentationsFilteringMode":"show_for_all"},"talk":{"id":"95da6d94f2b241b0945d6e37dc0daa4d","name":{"ru":"Закрытие первого дня конференции","en":"Закрытие первого дня конференции"},"talkOrder":50,"longDescription":{"ru":"<p>Подводим итоги дня, вспоминаем яркие моменты и рассказываем о дальнейших планах. Ждем вас в зале!</p>","en":"<p>Подводим итоги дня, вспоминаем яркие моменты и рассказываем о дальнейших планах. Ждем вас в зале!</p>"},"isRussianLanguage":true,"speakers":[],"talkDay":1,"time":"2026-02-27T13:15:00Z","talkStartTime":"2026-02-27T13:15:00Z","talkEndTime":"2026-02-27T13:30:00Z","trackNumber":1,"tags":[],"videoLinks":[],"complexity":null,"talkId":20010246,"experts":[],"hosts":[{"id":"9cbc880fd47843e29e543fd37f95bbef","name":{"ru":"Иван Углянский","en":"Ivan Ugliansky"},"personRating":50,"company":{"ru":"Huawei","en":"Huawei"},"bio":{"ru":"<p>C 2011 года работал в компании Excelsior, где был одним из разработчиков Excelsior JET &mdash; сертифицированной реализации Java SE, основанной на оптимизирующей AOT-компиляции. Сейчас работаю над компиляторами, JVM и новыми языками программирования. В основном занимаюсь рантаймом: GC, загрузкой классов, поддержкой многопоточности, профилированием и так далее.</p>\n<p>Сооснователь и один из лидеров JUGNsk &mdash; официальной Java User Group в Новосибирске. Один из основателей профиля &laquo;Системное программирование&raquo; на ММФ НГУ, где преподаю на многих курсах.</p>","en":"<p>I worked for Excelsior in the Excelsior JET project (Java SE certified implementation based on optimizing AOT compilation). Now I work for Huawei on JVMs, compilers, and new programming languages. I mainly work with runtime: GC, class loading, concurrency maintenance, profiling, and so on.</p>\n<p>I'm also the co-founder and co-lead of JUGNsk, an official Java Users Group in Novosibirsk. In my free time, I teach C++, algorithms and Python courses at Novosibirsk State University.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"1u8fr0uaS7sLocTSy8MCZ4","title":"kXjgjPbMYcY.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/1u8fr0uaS7sLocTSy8MCZ4/kxjgjpbmycy.jpg","fileName":"kXjgjPbMYcY.jpg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":353,"height":346}}},"contacts":[{"type":"github","value":"https://github.com/ugliansky"}],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"position":{"ru":"Эксперт","en":"Expert"},"contributorId":22000214},{"id":"6cbdfa6071dc4fa3925fbdc8e3d123fe","name":{"ru":"Владимир Плизга","en":"Vladimir Plizga"},"personRating":50,"company":{"ru":"Tibbo Systems","en":"Tibbo Systems"},"bio":{"ru":"<p>Со школьной скамьи увлечен программированием и с тех пор успел покодировать на многом: от советских программируемых калькуляторов до современных станков с ЧПУ. Почти 15 последних лет профессиональной карьеры посвятил разработке бэкенда на Java: сначала в финтехе, затем в промышленном IoT.</p><p>Люблю помогать людям, поэтому, кроме организации регулярных TechTalks в своих командах, выступаю на митапах и конференциях. Иногда пишу статьи по темам вокруг JVM и разрабатываю open source-инструменты для упрощения повседневных задач бэкенд-разработки и тестирования.</p><p>Веду тренинги по производительности приложений на Java. Автор Telegram-канала <a href=\"https://t.me/stopshelf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">«Верхняя полка»</a>, в котором делюсь своими мыслями и наблюдениями.</p>\n","en":"<p>Vladimir has been passionate about programming since his school days and had the opportunity to code on a variety of platforms: from Soviet programmable calculators to modern CNC machines. However, for the past 10+ years of his professional career, he has dedicated himself to backend development using Java: first in fintech, and then in industrial IoT.</p>\n<p>He enjoys helping people, so in addition to organizing regular TechTalks within his teams, he speaks at meetups and conferences, occasionally writes articles on topics related to JVM, and develops open-source tools to simplify everyday tasks in backend development and testing.</p>\n<p>He conducts training sessions on Java application performance. Author of the Telegram channel <a href=\"https://t.me/stopshelf\">&lsquo;Top Shelf&rsquo;</a> where he shares his thoughts and observations.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"37153177-3988-4f38-b72e-0abe47274ab4","title":"Vladimir-4.jpg","url":"/squidex/srm/37153177-3988-4f38-b72e-0abe47274ab4/vladimir-4.jpg","fileName":"Vladimir-4.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","details":{"image":{"width":606,"height":606}}},"contacts":[{"type":"github","value":"https://github.com/Toparvion"}],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"position":{"ru":"Ведущий инженер-программист","en":"Leading Software Engineer"},"contributorId":22005194}],"technicalTags":[],"type":"conversation","scope":"regular","topics":[],"isServiceTalk":false,"partners":[],"hall":{"ru":"Большой конференц-зал","en":"Большой конференц-зал"}},"useEmbeddedLive":false},"__N_SSG":true}